            <title>[LU-21269] requests counters between commits</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21269</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Add counters to track how many ptlrpc requests accumulate between updates to obd_last_committed. This helps diagnose commit latency issues where requests pile up before the last_committed transno advances.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We used it to compare the differences between the ldiskfs and zfs backends, and how many maximum requests would be sent during recovery. Since recovery is a single-threaded process with time limits, there is a maximum number of RPCs that can be handled during it. Therefore, the commit time and queue need to be tuned to ensure that recovery finishes on time.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
